@startuml A3_01_component_neo4j_graph_simple
title Neo4j Knowledge Graph – Simplified View

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #000000
  BorderThickness 1
}

rectangle "Neo4j Knowledge Graph" as NEO4J {
  rectangle "Nodes & relationships\n(curriculum-focused in repo)" as ENTITIES
  rectangle "Read paths\n(Cypher via rag_graph)" as OPS
}

cloud "rag_graph\n(prerequisite gateway)" as RAG_GRAPH
cloud "Agent Service\n(LangGraph tools)" as AGENT
cloud "Enrollment Service\n(planned)" as ENROLLMENT

RAG_GRAPH --> OPS : `/prereqs`, `/program`
AGENT --> RAG_GRAPH : HTTP (tools)
ENROLLMENT ..> OPS : **planned** audits / transfer

note right of NEO4J
**In production wiring**
Agent does **not** open a Neo4j driver;
only **rag_graph** queries the graph today.
end note

@enduml
